{"3715040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DekaDuck", "steam_appid": 3715040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Now live on Kickstarter!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715040/extras/001fa5314964e1fd382b1d6766a159f5.avif?t=1783344727\" width=1516 height=897 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715040/extras/acb7e387f8b575f1044ed3f099332a59.poster.avif?t=1783344727\" width=574 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715040/extras/acb7e387f8b575f1044ed3f099332a59.webm?t=1783344727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715040/extras/acb7e387f8b575f1044ed3f099332a59.mp4?t=1783344727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Visualshock! Speedshock! Soundshock!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DekaDuck</strong> is a fast-paced, hand-drawn 2D action platformer starring<strong> </strong>a <strong>half-duck</strong>, <strong>half-robot</strong> bounty hunter with an attitude. <strong>Dash, shoot, and grab</strong> your way through <strong>six secret-packed planets</strong>, defeat towering <strong>bosses</strong>, and bring the galaxy's most w<strong>anted criminals</strong> to justice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715040/extras/3aeaaea7701724b5447de81abce451fb.poster.avif?t=1783344727\" width=650 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715040/extras/3aeaaea7701724b5447de81abce451fb.webm?t=1783344727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715040/extras/3aeaaea7701724b5447de81abce451fb.mp4?t=1783344727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While fleeing the <strong>Intergalactic Police</strong>, the brilliant and morally flexible <strong>Dr. Less</strong>, his daugther <strong>Petite</strong> and her pet duck <strong>Deka</strong> crash-land on an <strong>uncharted planet </strong>alongside  the police ship that was chasing him. Stranded and desperate, he uses what's left of his daughter's pet duck and a whole lot of <strong>illegal tech</strong> to create <strong>DEKADUCK</strong>: a one-of-a-kind <strong>cybernetic marvel!</strong> With the new body, <strong>Deka</strong> is perfect for <strong>hunting bounties</strong> across the stars. Now <strong>DekaDuck</strong> works the <strong>criminal underworld</strong> from the inside, taking down targets while staying one step ahead of the very cops who'd love to decommission him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715040/extras/e1fcad5b670afb147bdf14ddfc2c52b5.poster.avif?t=1783344727\" width=680 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715040/extras/e1fcad5b670afb147bdf14ddfc2c52b5.webm?t=1783344727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715040/extras/e1fcad5b670afb147bdf14ddfc2c52b5.mp4?t=1783344727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, fluid combat</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together dashes, shots, and teleport strikes at breakneck speed. Every encounter rewards aggression and precision! Standing still is not an option.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Throw Hands</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dekaduck's detachable hand is your greatest weapon. Grab enemies out of the air, hurl them into each other, swing from platforms, snatch items from across the screen! If you can see it, you can probably grab it.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use enemy abilities</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grabbing isn't just for throwing. Snag a bat to use it as a boomerang, latch onto a spring-loaded enemy to rocket-jump, or turn tiny duck-bots into walking bombs. Every enemy is a tool waiting to be exploited.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Weapons</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find new chips with powerful new tools and weapons that Dekaduck can equip, giving him extreme new abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715040/extras/4733ad21d92f292896ddb42fbb580a66.poster.avif?t=1783344727\" width=680 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715040/extras/4733ad21d92f292896ddb42fbb580a66.webm?t=1783344727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715040/extras/4733ad21d92f292896ddb42fbb580a66.mp4?t=1783344727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six fully hand-drawn worlds</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast off from Dr. Less' ship to explore six distinct planets, each packed with hidden areas, unique enemies, and a massive boss fight. Every frame is drawn by hand.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A cast of weirdos</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Aiko, the Intergalactic Police Captain who definitely has a crush on Dekaduck (awkward), and Ekos, a shady arms dealer who sells weapons in the most literal sense possible. The galaxy is full of strange friends and stranger enemies.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Killer soundtrack</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring an original score by Dominic Ninmark that drives every dash, grab, and boss showdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715040/extras/5752753e3d1bd3112504365711b9bb32.avif?t=1783344727\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715040/extras_big/5752753e3d1bd3112504365711b9bb32.webp?t=1783344727 width=1560 height=1248 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note - No animals were harmed in the making of this game.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715040/extras/acb7e387f8b575f1044ed3f099332a59.poster.avif?t=1783344727\" width=574 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715040/extras/acb7e387f8b575f1044ed3f099332a59.webm?t=1783344727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715040/extras/acb7e387f8b575f1044ed3f099332a59.mp4?t=1783344727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Visualshock! Speedshock! Soundshock!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DekaDuck</strong> is a fast-paced, hand-drawn 2D action platformer starring<strong> </strong>a <strong>half-duck</strong>, <strong>half-robot</strong> bounty hunter with an attitude. <strong>Dash, shoot, and grab</strong> your way through <strong>six secret-packed planets</strong>, defeat towering <strong>bosses</strong>, and bring the galaxy's most w<strong>anted criminals</strong> to justice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715040/extras/3aeaaea7701724b5447de81abce451fb.poster.avif?t=1783344727\" width=650 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715040/extras/3aeaaea7701724b5447de81abce451fb.webm?t=1783344727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715040/extras/3aeaaea7701724b5447de81abce451fb.mp4?t=1783344727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While fleeing the <strong>Intergalactic Police</strong>, the brilliant and morally flexible <strong>Dr. Less</strong>, his daugther <strong>Petite</strong> and her pet duck <strong>Deka</strong> crash-land on an <strong>uncharted planet </strong>alongside  the police ship that was chasing him. Stranded and desperate, he uses what's left of his daughter's pet duck and a whole lot of <strong>illegal tech</strong> to create <strong>DEKADUCK</strong>: a one-of-a-kind <strong>cybernetic marvel!</strong> With the new body, <strong>Deka</strong> is perfect for <strong>hunting bounties</strong> across the stars. Now <strong>DekaDuck</strong> works the <strong>criminal underworld</strong> from the inside, taking down targets while staying one step ahead of the very cops who'd love to decommission him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715040/extras/e1fcad5b670afb147bdf14ddfc2c52b5.poster.avif?t=1783344727\" width=680 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715040/extras/e1fcad5b670afb147bdf14ddfc2c52b5.webm?t=1783344727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715040/extras/e1fcad5b670afb147bdf14ddfc2c52b5.mp4?t=1783344727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, fluid combat</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together dashes, shots, and teleport strikes at breakneck speed. Every encounter rewards aggression and precision! Standing still is not an option.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Throw Hands</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dekaduck's detachable hand is your greatest weapon. Grab enemies out of the air, hurl them into each other, swing from platforms, snatch items from across the screen! If you can see it, you can probably grab it.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use enemy abilities</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grabbing isn't just for throwing. Snag a bat to use it as a boomerang, latch onto a spring-loaded enemy to rocket-jump, or turn tiny duck-bots into walking bombs. Every enemy is a tool waiting to be exploited.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Weapons</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find new chips with powerful new tools and weapons that Dekaduck can equip, giving him extreme new abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></